                        ],
                        "form": "скоропости́жна"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "3ca301f3-3876-4de1-8965-9b04f85b7fed",
                        "entry_id": "7dcaaeaf-0535-3a6d-a3cb-709af0edb032",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "скоропости́жны"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b0152227-9c0b-345d-ae69-5677b9d220e6",
                        "entry_id": "7dcaaeaf-0535-3a6d-a3cb-709af0edb032",
                        "glosses": [
                            "внезапный, неожиданный, случившийся очень быстро (обычно о смерти)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a28426d-7742-4c80-a437-913d2bff3f8f",
                                "sense_id": "b0152227-9c0b-345d-ae69-5677b9d220e6",
                                "text": "И тогда можно будет очень легко объяснить эту скоропостижную смерть неудачным прыжком."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b3f54d0-c52f-4eb9-91ca-89fddb4cf5e7",
                                "sense_id": "b0152227-9c0b-345d-ae69-5677b9d220e6",
                                "text": "В Елизаветино время о нём сказал бы Бестужев-Рюмин: «Человек припадочный (случайный) и скоропостижный»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f49f6173-0b21-4c06-94ce-a8ce744550e3",
                                "sense_id": "b0152227-9c0b-345d-ae69-5677b9d220e6",
                                "text": "Непредсказуемо ведет себя электрон. Появилось даже скоропостижное мнение о «свободе воли» у электрона."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e002123c-ebc4-4709-b911-330934491924",
                        "source_entry_id": "7dcaaeaf-0535-3a6d-a3cb-709af0edb032",
                        "source_sense_id": "b0152227-9c0b-345d-ae69-5677b9d220e6",
                        "target_lang_word": "sudden",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sudden",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c12cb270-09c2-327c-ad83-d31f2042a0af",
                                        "entry_id": "0bf13c81-28f0-3115-813b-b23ff30a89a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Occurring quickly with little or no warning or expectation; instantly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54016c4c-f135-4d5c-bb0a-899d0ca8d592",
                                                "sense_id": "c12cb270-09c2-327c-ad83-d31f2042a0af",
                                                "text": "The sudden drop in temperature left everyone cold and confused."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e44cee3-270e-4aa8-ba9b-68f5b80c51f9",
                                                "sense_id": "c12cb270-09c2-327c-ad83-d31f2042a0af",
                                                "text": "From lightninges and tempeſtes, from plage, peſtilence, and famine, from battayle and murther, and from ſodayn death. / Good lord deliver us."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70a4a473-c762-482f-bd8e-83b409a65dfa",
                                                "sense_id": "c12cb270-09c2-327c-ad83-d31f2042a0af",
                                                "text": "I stumbled along through the young pines and huckleberry bushes. Pretty soon I struck into a sort of path that, I cal'lated, might lead to the road I was hunting for. It twisted and turned, and, the first thing I knew, made a sudden bend around a bunch of bayberry scrub and opened out into a big clear space like a lawn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df879b2a-38c2-3151-94db-11ef66c1013d",
                                        "entry_id": "0bf13c81-28f0-3115-813b-b23ff30a89a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hastily prepared or employed; quick; rapid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef92239c-fc82-4cb4-8913-c03fb69503cb",
                                                "sense_id": "df879b2a-38c2-3151-94db-11ef66c1013d",
                                                "text": "Never was such a sudden scholar made."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2804c7ee-4f45-4ab0-b0cc-3d70bd2d0d01",
                                                "sense_id": "df879b2a-38c2-3151-94db-11ef66c1013d",
                                                "text": "Thus these pious flourishes and colours, examined thoroughly, are like the apples of Asphaltis, appearing goodly to the sudden eye; but look well upon them, or at least but touch them, and they turn into cinders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c504bd0a-1177-4774-b60c-cf236b60ba4e",
                                                "sense_id": "df879b2a-38c2-3151-94db-11ef66c1013d",
                                                "text": "And if along with these should come\n⁠The man I held as half-divine;\n⁠Should strike a sudden hand in mine,\nAnd ask a thousand things of home; […]\nI should not feel it to be strange."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b634405d-a1c1-3eb5-b165-192f0881a0e1",
                                        "entry_id": "0bf13c81-28f0-3115-813b-b23ff30a89a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hasty; violent; rash; precipitate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c360a98-d870-417f-a7c5-08c59d412076",
                                                "sense_id": "b634405d-a1c1-3eb5-b165-192f0881a0e1",
                                                "text": "I have no joy of this contract to-night: / It is too rash, too unadvised, too sudden;"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sudden",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62fecba7-7a73-3cd7-ae56-77f2f170be2d",
                                        "entry_id": "054c5fe2-1dd4-350f-9482-a724b09b0978",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suddenly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "poetic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e4e9bf2-8008-4a36-a603-e8660435247d",
                                                "sense_id": "62fecba7-7a73-3cd7-ae56-77f2f170be2d",
                                                "text": "Herbs of every leaf that sudden flowered."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sudden",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73236a3b-e036-36c4-9e5f-3ca20c22ff17",
                                        "entry_id": "80d88f87-9697-3765-ae04-a1d56f4f5104",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An unexpected occurrence; a surprise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aea75426-8c31-4cfd-9e0e-eb9ef8230410",
                        "source_entry_id": "7dcaaeaf-0535-3a6d-a3cb-709af0edb032",
                        "source_sense_id": "b0152227-9c0b-345d-ae69-5677b9d220e6",
                        "target_lang_word": "subit",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "subit",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74ef5c37-8034-3394-b82e-a2a789b6df9a",
                                        "entry_id": "7780a479-1dc1-3d91-a351-dcae9be3abb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est soudain ; qui arrive tout à coup."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "434de935-b2a4-491a-bbb8-c96a8f36c950",
                                                "sense_id": "74ef5c37-8034-3394-b82e-a2a789b6df9a",
                                                "text": "Toujours dure et sauvage, la mer de Bretagne a quelquefois des colères subites. Elle se soulevait ainsi tout à coup au déclin d'une splendide journée de juillet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6522f4be-8eef-4b9f-9daa-03ae09d7f168",
                                                "sense_id": "74ef5c37-8034-3394-b82e-a2a789b6df9a",
                                                "text": "Pour sonder son frère, Aristide, qui n’osait paraître inquiet ouvertement, se contenta de lui demander :\n— As-tu lu mon article d’hier ? Qu’en penses-tu ?\nEugène eut un léger mouvement d’épaules.\n— Vous êtes un niais, mon frère, répondit-il simplement.\n— Alors, s’écria le journaliste en pâlissant, tu donnes raison à Vuillet, tu crois au triomphe de Vuillet.\n— Moi !… Vuillet…\nIl allait certainement ajouter : « Vuillet est un niais comme toi. » Mais en apercevant la face grimaçante de son frère qui se tendait anxieusement vers lui, il parut pris d’une subite défiance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "658616a7-d019-4ab9-9f69-ca060f363ccc",
                                                "sense_id": "74ef5c37-8034-3394-b82e-a2a789b6df9a",
                                                "text": "Je répétai mentalement à plusieurs reprises cette syllabe ; « Morte, morte, morte... » et ce qu’elle représente de subit écroulement dans la nuit, d’irréparable chute dans le noir, le froid, le vide, me serra soudain le cœur."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "subit",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f58f8a99-57b1-33e9-8b3d-af0a1ba53a65",
                                        "entry_id": "f722a85a-970e-3f47-b093-d6db3c47f179",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Troisième personne du singulier de l’indicatif présent de subir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56e71d16-ef0f-4d82-9309-3d1ba9285e3a",
                                                "sense_id": "f58f8a99-57b1-33e9-8b3d-af0a1ba53a65",
                                                "text": "Le plomb débismuthé subit alors différents traitements afin d’éliminer les réactifs résiduels (traitement au chlore gazeux suivi d’un lavage à la soude et/ou aux nitrates)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69a211c1-1d36-3f73-a8d6-549309232028",
                                        "entry_id": "f722a85a-970e-3f47-b093-d6db3c47f179",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Troisième personne du singulier du passé simple de subir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
